{
  "_comment": "Jamba-100B: Jamba-1.5-style hybrid MoE for profiling. Pattern chars: M=mamba - =mlp *=attn #=moe (SimPipe symbols; Megatron uses E for moe). One HF jamba block = 2 layers (mixer+ffn). Mamba2 parameterization (state128/headdim64) approximates Jamba's mamba1.",
